usage: watch_actual_agent.py [-h] --repo REPO --run RUN --agent-dir AGENT_DIR
                             --python PYTHON --python-sha256 PYTHON_SHA256
                             --source-repos SOURCE_REPOS --metadata METADATA
                             --history-helper HISTORY_HELPER [--model MODEL]
                             [--publication-timeout-seconds PUBLICATION_TIMEOUT_SECONDS]

Original V45 live-agent watcher with the versioned controller path only. Model
execution, native-meter evidence, source release and all budgets retain their
original algorithms. Importing this helper starts no process or model.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --repo REPO
  --run RUN
  --agent-dir AGENT_DIR
  --python PYTHON
  --python-sha256 PYTHON_SHA256
  --source-repos SOURCE_REPOS
  --metadata METADATA
  --history-helper HISTORY_HELPER
  --model MODEL
  --publication-timeout-seconds PUBLICATION_TIMEOUT_SECONDS
